<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure — Where Is Baldo?" description="Affiliate Disclosure for whereisbaldo.com">
  <div class="post-header">
    <span class="post-tag">Legal</span>
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="post-meta">Effective Date: May 2026 · whereisbaldo.com</p>
  </div>
  <div class="post-body legal-body">

    <h2>The Simple Version</h2>
    <p>Some links on this blog make me money if you click them and buy something. You pay the same price either way — the commission comes from the company, not from you. This is how I keep the lights on while I travel and write.</p>

    <h2>How It Actually Works</h2>
    <p>When I recommend a hotel, travel insurance, a camera, or a tour company and include a link, it might be an affiliate link. That means if you click it and buy something, I get a small percentage of the sale. You don't pay extra for using my link. The price is identical whether you click mine or search for it yourself.</p>

    <h2>My Word On This</h2>
    <p>I only recommend things I actually believe in or have used myself. If a product is bad, I say it's bad — and I don't link to it or recommend it. Money doesn't change my opinions. If something doesn't work, you'll hear about it.</p>

    <h2>The Legal Side (FTC Stuff)</h2>
    <p>The FTC requires that I tell you about affiliate links. So: this blog might earn commission through affiliate programs. It happens all over this site — any link could potentially be an affiliate link. I usually note it in the post if the link is one.</p>

    <h2>Who Do I Work With?</h2>
    <p>This list changes as the blog grows, but I might have affiliate relationships with: Amazon, Booking.com, Hotels.com, GetYourGuide, travel insurance companies, and other travel-related services.</p>

    <h2>Got Questions?</h2>
    <p>If you're ever confused about whether a link is an affiliate link or want to know more about how this works, email me: <a href="mailto:baldolanded@gmail.com">baldolanded@gmail.com</a></p>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-body h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
